There are many shady looking people hanging outside of this location which makes a bit scary so I normally only use the curbside pickup. Staff is always nice and try to get the people to leave but there is also only so much they can do."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-07-18 14:56:08', 'review_text': 'I ordered 5 "EGG sausage Mcmuffin and they gave me 3 Sausage "Burned" Mcmuffin people are looking to have a good breakfast and you will give me shitty thing work, come on now!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-07-06 06:46:25', 'review_text': "Mind you I order so my food is hot. But this experience was different. It felt like they really cared. And the food was hot on point and im really really happy. I know I know it's McDonalds and when your hungry u want hot food.. here everything was hot and perfect. Ty ladies I'm very happy and hope you have a great night."}]}
